{"3370950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Phantom Demon Siege", "steam_appid": 3370950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIEGE OF THE GHOST DEMON</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demonic creatures have emerged from the shadows, transforming cities, forests, and abandoned facilities into territories dominated by chaos. Your only option is to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monsters, creatures, and supernatural aberrations as you explore maps filled with dangers, resources, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters, creatures, and supernatural aberrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various weapons to find and use</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental online co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to survive the siege of the monsters?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIEGE OF THE GHOST DEMON</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demonic creatures have emerged from the shadows, transforming cities, forests, and abandoned facilities into territories dominated by chaos. Your only option is to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monsters, creatures, and supernatural aberrations as you explore maps filled with dangers, resources, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters, creatures, and supernatural aberrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various weapons to find and use</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental online co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to survive the siege of the monsters?</p>", "short_description"